  "exact": {
    ". The": "组成。",
    "03 / 05": "03 / 05",
    "and": "与",
    "And as you can imagine, this can't go on forever. Every model has a hard-coded limit for the number of tokens it can see at any one time.": "可以想象，这不可能无限持续。每个模型对一次能够看到的 Token 数量都有硬性限制。",
    "And so even if that model supports a big context window, you'll definitely still get better results from using fewer tokens in the context.": "所以，即使模型支持很大的上下文窗口，减少上下文中的 Token 数量通常仍会得到更好的结果。",
    "As the conversation gets longer, as more and more messages get put into the conversation, the number of tokens used grows.": "随着对话变长、越来越多消息被加入，所使用的 Token 数量也会增长。",
    "But the biggest issue with context windows is that the bigger they get, the more \"lost in the middle\" issues you get.": "但上下文窗口最大的问题是：窗口越大，“迷失在中间”的现象越严重。",
    "Context Window Limits": "上下文窗口限制",
    "If we imagine a huge conversation, where these rings are the individual messages, the messages at the start of the history have quite a big impact on the output, and the ones at the end do too, but the stuff in the middle the LLM pays a bit less attention to.": "设想一段超长对话，每个圆环代表一条消息。历史开头和结尾的消息对输出影响较大，而 LLM 对位于中间的内容会少分配一些注意力。",
    "If we imagine a super long conversation, eventually we will hit a limit. And if you try to query the LLM with this super long conversation and you hit the limit, then you will probably get some kind of error back from the API.": "如果对话非常长，最终一定会触及限制。此时再把整段超长对话发送给 LLM，API 很可能返回错误。",
    "is made up of input and": "由输入 Token 和",
    "might include a system prompt and a user prompt (the message from the user). And then the output tokens is whatever the assistant comes back with:": "可能包括系统提示词和用户提示词（用户发送的消息），输出 Token 则是助手返回的内容：",
    "output tokens combined.": "输出 Token 共同组成。",
    "So when you're assessing a model, you shouldn't just think, \"wow, this context window limit's huge, that's incredible, I can put so much stuff in there.\"": "因此评估模型时，不应该只想着：“哇，这个上下文窗口太大了，真厉害，我可以塞进去这么多东西。”",
    "That model will still probably have lost-in-the-middle issues. It may even have trouble retrieving information from its own context window.": "这个模型仍然可能出现迷失在中间的问题，甚至可能难以从自己的上下文窗口中找回信息。",
    "The": "这个",
    "The \"Lost in the Middle\" Problem": "“迷失在中间”问题",
    "The context window is the input": "上下文窗口由输入",
    "The model itself isn't quite smart enough to work around its own context window limits. And so you will hit issues like this sometimes.": "模型本身还没有聪明到能够绕开自己的上下文窗口限制，因此有时确实会遇到这种问题。",
    "This is a well-known phenomenon and it's much more pronounced the larger the context window gets.": "这是一个广为人知的现象，而且上下文窗口越大，表现得越明显。",
    "You might even hit the limit during the generation of a message. So this message might start outside the context window limit, but as it goes or it carries on until it hits the context window limit.": "甚至可能在消息生成过程中触及限制：生成开始时还没有超出上下文窗口，但继续输出后便到达上限。",
